<noinclude>
{{Documentation|doc =
This template is an alternate way of using <code><[[mw:Extension:SyntaxHighlight|syntaxhighlight]]></code> with some added functionality.

== Usage ==
This template is used to show syntax-highlighted text.

This may be used for articles with segments of code extracted from the game files.

=== Parameters ===
;<code>1</code> <code>code</code>
:The code to be displayed.
;<code>2</code> <code>lang</code>
:Defines the programming language for the syntax highlighting. Highlighting uses the [https://pygments.org/languages/ pygments library]. Default to <code>text</code>. A custom lexer <code>zedscripts</code> is also implemented in the [[MediaWiki:Common.js]] for [[Scripts]] syntax highlighting.
;<code>source</code>
:Name of the source file. Some script files will automatically determine the <code>path</code>.
;<code>path</code>
:The file path of the source file. Will not display if <code>source</code> is empty. Default to <code>ProjectZomboid\media\scripts\</code>.
;<code>line</code>
:If <code>true</code>, line numbers will be displayed.
;<code>start</code>
:Line number to start at. <code>line</code> must be defined.
;<code>retrieved</code>
:If <code>true</code>, will add {{tll|Retrieved}}. Refer to that template for parameters.

== Examples ==
=== HTML language example ===
<pre>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = html
| code = 
<div style="font-weight:bold; color:#3434ff;">
    Some text goes here.<br>More text here
</div>
}}
</pre>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = html
| code = 
<div style="font-weight:bold; color:#3434ff;">
    Some text goes here.<br>More text here
</div>
}}

=== Source example ===
<pre>
{{CodeSnip|source=newitems.txt}}
</pre>
{{CodeSnip|source=newitems.txt}}

=== Source and file path example ===
<pre>
{{CodeSnip
| source = IsoPlayer.class
| path = ProjectZomboid\zombie\characters
}}
</pre>
{{CodeSnip|source=IsoPlayer.class|path=ProjectZomboid\zombie\characters}}

=== Item code with source and zedscripts language ===
<pre>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = zedscripts
| source = items_weapons.txt
| code =
item Glue
{
    DisplayCategory = Material,
    Weight	=	0.1,
    Type	=	Drainable,
    UseDelta	=	0.2,
    UseWhileEquipped	=	FALSE,
    DisplayName	=	Glue,
    Icon	=	Glue,
    Tooltip = Tooltip_FixItems,
    SurvivalGear = TRUE,
    WorldStaticModel = Glue,
    Tags = Glue,
}
}}
</pre>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = zedscripts
| source = items_weapons.txt
| code =
item Glue
{
    DisplayCategory = Material,
    Weight	=	0.1,
    Type	=	Drainable,
    UseDelta	=	0.2,
    UseWhileEquipped	=	FALSE,
    DisplayName	=	Glue,
    Icon	=	Glue,
    Tooltip = Tooltip_FixItems,
    SurvivalGear = TRUE,
    WorldStaticModel = Glue,
    Tags = Glue,
}
}}

=== Java code with source and path defined ===
<pre>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = java
| source = RDSPrisonEscape.class
| path = ProjectZomboid\zombie\randomizedWorld\randomizedDeadSurvivor
| code =
public RDSPrisonEscape() {
    this.name = "Prison Escape";
    this.setChance(3);
    this.setMaximumDays(90);
    this.setUnique(true);
}
}}
</pre>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = java
| source = RDSPrisonEscape.class
| path = ProjectZomboid\zombie\randomizedWorld\randomizedDeadSurvivor
| code =
public RDSPrisonEscape() {
    this.name = "Prison Escape";
    this.setChance(3);
    this.setMaximumDays(90);
    this.setUnique(true);
}
}}

=== Item code with source, zedscripts language, line number and {{tll|Retrieved}} ===
<pre>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = zedscripts
| line = true
| start = 92
| source = items.txt
| retrieved = true
| version = 41.78.16
| code =
item BucketEmpty
{
    DisplayCategory = WaterContainer,
    Weight	=	1,
    CanStoreWater	=	TRUE,
    Type	=	Normal,
    DisplayName	=	Bucket,
    Icon	=	MetalBucket,
    ReplaceOnUseOn = WaterSource-BucketWaterFull,
    MetalValue = 20,
    RainFactor = 1,
    Tooltip = Tooltip_item_RainFromGround,
    EatType = Bucket,
    SurvivalGear = TRUE,
    WorldStaticModel = Bucket_Ground,
}
}}
</pre>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = zedscripts
| line = true
| start = 92
| source = items.txt
| retrieved = true
| version = 41.78.16
| code =
item BucketEmpty
{
    DisplayCategory = WaterContainer,
    Weight	=	1,
    CanStoreWater	=	TRUE,
    Type	=	Normal,
    DisplayName	=	Bucket,
    Icon	=	MetalBucket,
    ReplaceOnUseOn = WaterSource-BucketWaterFull,
    MetalValue = 20,
    RainFactor = 1,
    Tooltip = Tooltip_item_RainFromGround,
    EatType = Bucket,
    SurvivalGear = TRUE,
    WorldStaticModel = Bucket_Ground,
}
}}

{{Translation guide|<syntaxhighlight lang="html">
{{#switch: {{{1|}}}
| source = Source:
| #default = {{Error|translation}}
}}
</syntaxhighlight>
''Note: the [[Template:Retrieved|retrieved]] template may also need to be translated.''}}

